# STIG AS24-U1-000970: The Apache web server htpasswd files (if present) must refle
# STIG ID: V-214274 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `apache-as24-u1-000970-conf-dir-perms-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `apache`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG AS24-U1-000970: The Apache web server htpasswd files (if present) must reflect proper ownership `
    description `The Apache web server htpasswd files (if present) must reflect proper ownership and permissions.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `apache,stig,disa-stig,permissions`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:AS24-U1-000970,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Apache:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Apache STIG guidance for AS24-U1-000970.`

    component_id `comp-apache-web`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the Apache HTTP server configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/etc/httpd/conf`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE meta_check
        exists boolean = true
        permissions string = `0750`
        owner_id string = `0`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF meta_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
